  "description": "Taekil Goo. For him, his daily life was a series of boredom. Studying and staying at home were boring in everyday life, what he chose was an unconscious and meaningless runaway life. He headed to Wonju, and at the young age of 18, the world was full of curios things, and the people he met there were various. That is how a young boy, is adjusting to society. How will he live in a difficult world?\n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 6 extra chapters.*",
